{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the story of how humanity and robots come to their end.</h2><br>In a world where humanity has perished, a lone robot, [Libera], awakens.<br>Why did it awaken now? Why is it wearing a white coat? For what purpose was it created?<br><br>As Libera walks through the ruins of the lost world,<br>it slowly begins to recover fragments of its memories.<br>And in time, it learns the truth of the <strong>&quot;end&quot;</strong> that humanity met.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/ecaaeffe7753e20a2919bd852d84aa13.poster.avif?t=1765032906\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/ecaaeffe7753e20a2919bd852d84aa13.webm?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/ecaaeffe7753e20a2919bd852d84aa13.mp4?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2500\u2500And that was also the <strong>&quot;end&quot;</strong> for the robots.<br>Robots were made to live for humans.<br>Then, in a world without humans, there is no reason for them to exist.<br><br>When Libera has finally regained all of its memories\u2500\u2500<br>it quietly shuts itself down.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A post-apocalyptic pixel-art story adventure, walking beside a robot.</h2><br>In a World After People is a quiet and beautiful <strong>pixel-art adventure</strong><br>that follows the robot [Libera] as it explores the post-human world.<br><br>Through exploration, you will collect records and fragments of memories,<br>gradually uncovering the story of humanity\u2019s extinction and the \u201cpurpose\u201d that Libera was created for.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/bb5c0e3ba137cae9be35b2ee9dba81c2.poster.avif?t=1765032906\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/bb5c0e3ba137cae9be35b2ee9dba81c2.webm?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/bb5c0e3ba137cae9be35b2ee9dba81c2.mp4?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Investigate your surroundings, use items, and solve small puzzles\u2014<br>a gentle yet immersive experience awaits you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A desolate pixel world of light and shadow, rich with depth and atmosphere.</h2><br>The game\u2019s pixel art, with its meticulous lighting, is one of its most distinctive features.<br>Flickering fluorescent lights, illuminated spaces, and the soft shadow cast by Libera\u2014<br>each element paints the silence of a lost world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/3aa52d42a3365014671498c16ed1fefb.poster.avif?t=1765032906\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/3aa52d42a3365014671498c16ed1fefb.webm?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/3aa52d42a3365014671498c16ed1fefb.mp4?t=1765032906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A world that feels flat, yet has a quiet sense of depth.<br>A space where nostalgia and newness, loneliness and warmth coexist.<br><br>Please, in this world, feel the <strong>loneliness and beauty</strong> of what it means to live \u201cwithout people.\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Demo</h2><strong>The demo lets you experience the first 15 minutes of the game.</strong><br>It offers a glimpse into the story\u2019s beginning and atmosphere.<br>Please note that save data will not carry over to the full version.<br>The full release will be further refined and polished.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</h2>Streaming and video sharing are warmly welcomed.<br>Please check the official guidelines via \u201cVisit Website\u201d on the right side of this page.<br>You\u2019ll also find downloadable assets such as thumbnails there.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314030?t=1765032906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314030?t=1765032906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/44f3546ef07045a4ffd45c6f85723de50a27e767/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765032906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/44f3546ef07045a4ffd45c6f85723de50a27e767/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765032906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes related to death.\r\nIt does not include graphic or overly grotesque depictions."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3841550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the story of how humanity and robots come to their end.</h2><br>In a world where humanity has perished, a lone robot, [Libera], awakens.<br>Why did it awaken now? Why is it wearing a white coat? For what purpose was it created?<br><br>As Libera walks through the ruins of the lost world,<br>it slowly begins to recover fragments of its memories.<br>And in time, it learns the truth of the <strong>&quot;end&quot;</strong> that humanity met.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https