tiful pixel-art story adventure.","steam_appid":3314030,"support_info":{"email":"contact@yoruroji.com","url":"https://yoruroji.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://yoruroji.com/in-a-world-after-people"}